title: Party Agenda
subtitle: Organisational work, collections, the apparatus, TUR courses and cooperatives.
is-pinned-card: true
card-image: img/flags.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.agendaAvailable(Q) !}
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
// The party's standing actions outside the hand (technical reference 4.4, 13.1–13.2, 17.2; card
// catalogue 5.5–5.9): each costs this month's action; organisational work is always there and needs no money.
PolishParty.agendaView(Q);
// Stage 7: the assessment of the forces of the state is a standing action of this agenda (card catalogue 6.8).
if (Q.polish_security_rules && typeof PolishSecurity !== 'undefined' && PolishSecurity.ready(Q)) Q.pl_pa_assess_why = PolishSecurity.assessStatus(Q).reason;
!}

= The party agenda

Party money: [+ pl_party_cash +]; [+ pl_party_ledger +]. [? if pl_party_arrears : [+ pl_party_arrears +] ?]

TUR: [+ pl_party_tur +]. Cooperatives: [+ pl_party_coops +].

[? if pl_pa_priorities : Economic priorities of PPS: [+ pl_pa_priorities +]. Each is prepared through its government card, with its own costs. ?]

- @organize
- @fundraise
- @apparatus
- @courses
- @launch_cooperative
- @kpp_trial
- @kpp_rules
- @kpp_agreement
- @assess_forces
- @later

@fundraise
title: An extraordinary collection
subtitle: +[+ pl_pa_fundraise_gain +] R (dues × membership / 100); waits 3 months.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.fundraiseStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pa_fundraise_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.fundraise(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@apparatus
title: Build up the party apparatus
subtitle: 2 R; one level more (up to 4): income +0.15 R × membership/100 and upkeep +0.10 R a month.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.apparatusStatus(Q).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pa_apparatus_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.buildApparatus(Q);
!}
go-to: result

@organize
title: Organisational work
subtitle: No money; +2 reach of one union branch or +2 base reach of PPS among one class.
go-to: organize_menu

@organize_menu
new-page: true

= Organisational work

Organisers work without money. The gain is multiplied by the character of the party where it matches, and by TUR cadres (together at most ×1.30).

- @branch_industry
- @branch_rail
- @branch_farm_labour
- @class_workers
- @class_rural
- @class_new_middle
- @class_old_middle
- @class_bourgeois_landowners
- @polish_party_agenda: Back to the agenda.

@branch_industry
title: Work in the industrial branch
subtitle: Reach of the branch +2.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.organizeStatus(Q, 'branch:industry').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pa_branch_industry_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.organizeWithoutFunds(Q, 'branch:industry');
!}
go-to: result

