@courses
title: A TUR course
subtitle: 1 T, 1 R; two financed months; one course at a time, then 4 months before the next.
view-if: {! return Q.S.party_orgs.tur.level >= 1 !}
go-to: courses_menu

@courses_menu
new-page: true

= TUR courses

A course gives its result only after two financed months of TUR. An unfinanced month makes it wait.

- @course_civil_rights
- @course_union_cadres
- @course_social_reform
- @course_national_education
- @polish_party_agenda: Back to the agenda.

@course_civil_rights
title: Civil rights and the practice of democracy (level 1)
subtitle: Among one class: radicalisation −3; its next democracy campaign within 6 months gains +0.10, once.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.courseStatus(Q, 'civil_rights').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pa_course_civil_rights_why +]
go-to: civil_rights_menu

@civil_rights_menu
new-page: true

= Civil rights course: for whom?

- @civil_workers
- @civil_rural
- @civil_new_middle
- @civil_old_middle
- @civil_bourgeois_landowners
- @courses_menu: Back to the courses.

@civil_workers
title: For the workers
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.turCourse(Q, 'civil_rights', 'workers');
!}
go-to: result

@civil_rural
