@course_union_cadres
title: Union cadres and the line of PPS (level 2)
subtitle: One branch: trust +3, dissent −4; it does not order the union to follow another line.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.courseStatus(Q, 'union_cadres').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pa_course_union_cadres_why +]
go-to: cadres_menu

@cadres_menu
new-page: true

= Union cadres course: which branch?

- @cadres_industry
- @cadres_rail
- @cadres_farm_labour
- @courses_menu: Back to the courses.

@cadres_industry
title: For the industrial branch
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.turCourse(Q, 'union_cadres', 'industry');
!}
go-to: result

@cadres_rail
title: For the railway branch
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.turCourse(Q, 'union_cadres', 'rail');
!}
